itle":"题 其二","author":"徐庸","text":"月满瑶台夜未央，满身风露拂衣凉。\n步虚欲待飞仙到，一曲云和一炷香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":32989,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陈醒庵丧妾 其一","author":"徐庸","text":"春水流花别浦长，东风一日九回肠。\n多情燕子虽营垒，那得衔来入画堂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":32990,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陈醒庵丧妾 其二","author":"徐庸","text":"小凤衾寒斗帐开，綵云飞去最堪哀。\n东君定有相思意，不似高唐入梦来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":32991,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"二乔观书","author":"徐庸","text":"宫妆初试凭阑干，玉女阴符取次看。\n教得孙周多妙策，东风一炬走曹瞒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":32992,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画 其一","author":"徐庸","text":"一片飞云带水流，碧山深处小亭幽。\n晚风自起岩前树，不见人来坐听秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":32993,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画 其二","author":"徐庸","text":"白石层层覆落花，薜垣萝屋隐沦家。\n扁舟有客清江上，问路来寻不惮赊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":32994,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画 其三","author":"徐庸","text":"幽亭构得倚沧洲，水国凉多五月秋。\n面面曲栏尘不到，藕花香里看眠鸥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":32995,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题矫以明所赠陈医师墨竹","author":"徐庸","text":"德星堂下种成林，奕叶相传几世阴。\n岁岁锦绷添稚子，生成全藉此君心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":32996,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和钱未斋所寄续赋榴子诗","author":"徐庸","text":"大钧生物有奇功，润泽吹嘘雨又风。\n榴子桂花今古事，一枝要比五枝红。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":32997,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"倦绣图 其一","author":"徐庸","text":"并蒂春花绣未成，一回思想一伤情。\n停针不语支颐久，人在龙沙万里行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":32998,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"倦绣图 其二","author":"徐庸","text":"东风庭院柳花香，每到春来怕日长。\n綵线未拈肠已断，可堪教绣并鸳鸯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":32999,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题竹寿朱竹泉 其一","author":"徐庸","text":"爱竹王猷未足誇，一枝今出紫阳家。\n岁寒不改青青色，相映蟠桃洞里花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":33000,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题竹寿朱竹泉 其二","author":"徐庸","text":"湘水淇园路自赊，一枝今出紫阳家。\n岁寒永保青青节，相映蟠桃海上花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":33001,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和靖观梅便面为吴德明作","author":"徐庸","text":"湖上观梅白玉英，与花曾结岁寒盟。\n花边要把琴三弄，琴里声非笛里声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":33002,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿星","author":"徐庸","text":"烱烱方瞳两点青，位高南极老人星。\n三光有象名长在，相与乾坤等寿龄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":33003,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"云壑","author":"徐庸","text":"白云满壑隐人居，闲傍青山自卷舒。\n霄汉无心不飞去，清阴长护案头书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":33004,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题竹","author":"徐庸","text":"九重天上被恩荣，冠带归来物外情。\n闲向碧琅玕底坐，月明吹彻凤凰笙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":33005,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题瓶中红梅","author":"徐庸","text":"山瓶小小寄先春，玄酒虽清亦醉人。\n啼彻翠禽浑未醒，莫忘姑射是前身。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":33006,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画送□九方","author":"徐庸","text":"绿蓑青笠著来轻，负荷轮竿又远行。\n自说溪河鱼懒钓，沧溟深处有长鲸。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":33007,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送九方次聂大年韵","author":"徐庸","text":"观光初入五云游，月殿香飘桂子秋。\n自古长才当大用，高名无忝占鳌头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":33008,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅竹","author":"徐庸","text":"姑射湘娥总是仙，半封寒雪半笼烟。\n曾吹玉笛生哀怨，瑶瑟休弹五十弦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":33009,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"失题 其一 画檐花影","author":"徐庸","text":"东风亭馆散香埃，秾杏夭桃几树开。\n丽日转高花有影，分明移上画帘来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":33010,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"失题 其二 入座山光","author":"徐庸","text":"缃帘一幅捲秋晴，数点峰峦入座清。\n浓淡自然分远近，天然图画在围屏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":33011,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]